  "title": {
   "en": "Jiki Koushaku Fujin no Yakuwari Dake o Motomete Kita, Koori no Bara to Utawareru Danna-sama ga Kateinai Stalker to Kashita Ken"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "次期公爵夫人の役割だけを求めてきた、氷の薔薇と謳われる旦那様が家庭内ストーカーと化した件"
   },
   {
    "en": "My Ice-Rose Husband Said He Only Wants Me to Play the Role of the Next Duchess, but Now He's Stalking Me at Home!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Viola, the daughter of a declining count (she was Japanese in her previous life), was married off to Albert―the next duke―by her parents. However, on the very first night of their marriage, her husband declares, “All I ask of you is that you carry out your role as the wife of the duke in appearance only,” effectively shattering any hope of a romantic relationship.\n\nDespite the soul-destroying statement from him, Viola picks up the pieces and starts to live happily and without restraints, announcing, “Forget my ice-cold, rude husband. I’m gonna live my life the way I want!” However, her new husband and mansion seem to hide a secret...?!\n\nIt’s a smothering romance of a reincarnated, happy-go-lucky lady who, by comforting the traumatized husband, turns him into the most doting of husbands♡\n\n(Source: K Manga)"
  },
